	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Setup

Enter your OpenAI API key and model ID in the fields on the right.

Create an API key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys. API usage is billed separately from a ChatGPT subscription.

## Usage

Open Alfred and type `q`, a space, and your question. Press Return. The answer appears in an Alfred Text View; press Escape to dismiss it.

The answer is shown in a compact Alfred 6 UI which expands for longer responses, up to a scrollable maximum height. Press Escape to dismiss it or Command-C to copy the full answer.

The model is entirely configurable and is never fixed in the script.</string>
